timeline
    title Havoc in Heaven - Incident Timeline
    section Escalation
      Day 1 : Wukong receives demeaning stable appointment
            : Political symbolism ignites distrust
      Day 2 : Wukong proclaims Great Sage Equal to Heaven
            : Heavenly court underestimates signal impact
    section Breach Operations
      Day 3 : Peach banquet disrupted at high profile event
      Day 4 : Elixir vault compromised in Laozi's hall
            : Target capability sharply increases
    section Response
      Day 5 : Heavenly divisions launch direct suppression
      Day 6 : Erlang Shen enters prolonged duel
      Day 7 : Containment protocol approved by high court
    section Aftermath
      Day 8 : Temporary containment achieved
            : Strategic review mandates adaptive defense doctrine
